==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Nana & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An incredibly easy stage, as Nana & Doge serves no threat and the Doges are only at a low magnification. Use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] to get the stage over with and claim the rewards.

